<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
the Effective Date, the Company&#8217;s board of directors approved and adopted the Company&#8217;s 2019 Equity Incentive Plan (the &#8220;2019
Plan&#8221;), which reserves a total of 1 share of the Company&#8217;s common stock for issuance under the 2019 Plan. Incentive awards
authorized under the 2019 Plan include, but are not limited to, incentive stock options, non-qualified stock options, restricted stock
awards and restricted stock units.</FONT></P>

